# Concept A — Expandable Rail

Rail stays narrow until project hovered/clicked → slides out task list.

## Behavior

- Default: `w-18` rail, project blobs only (current)
- Hover project blob → flyout panel appears to the right with that project's tasks
- Click pin icon → panel persists; rail becomes `w-72` total
- Tasks click → open task tab
- Search input top of flyout
- Show done toggle bottom of flyout

