## Pros

- Zero loss of existing rail UX
- Reveal-on-demand → no canvas cost when not in use
- Pinning gives persistence for power users

## Cons

- Hover-flyout fragile w/ trackpads, accidental dismiss
- Pin state per project? global? need decision
- Two interaction layers (rail + flyout) → more complex DnD
